#. 戦刃むくろが別の誰かとして
#. 殺されてるって？
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Who is this \"someone else\"\n"
"that Mukuro was killed as?"
msgstr ""

#. 別の誰かって…
#. <CLT 9>舞園さやか<CLT>さんの事？
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Was it...\n"
"<CLT 9>Sayaka Maizono<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>江ノ島盾子<CLT>さん？
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "<CLT 9>Junko Enoshima<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

